 "what_you_observe": [
  "Tuesday, February 2, 2016. Six am in the Hearthside Hotel. Three bright radio notes. A delivery van backfires twice.",
  "The crew meets for coffee at the hotel. The afternoon is open. A coat-check envelope holds the TV crew’s return fares. The party is at the ballroom tonight. A stranded driver needs a jack, and the ballroom piano is free.",
  "The Rialto is closing. The regional line can carry one last reel out of town. Alma wants her daughter in Pittsburgh to hear her voice."
 ],
